---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../../catalog/catalog.css';
---
<Base title="Catalog operations" description="Discover, retrieve and review product engineering tools and resources." noindex={true} searchable={false}>
  <div class="wrap ops" id="operations-app">
    <header class="ops-heading"><div><span class="label">ProductEngineer.pro / Operations</span><h1>Build a better library.</h1><p>Find sources on the web, retrieve the evidence, and decide what deserves a place in the atlas.</p></div><a href="/library/" class="btn small">Open the library ↗</a></header>
    <div id="ops-gate" class="ops-gate"><h2 id="ops-gate-title">Opening operations…</h2><p id="ops-gate-text">Checking your account access.</p><div class="btn-row" id="ops-signin"></div></div>
    <div id="ops-workspace" hidden>
      <div class="ops-stats" aria-label="Review overview"><button class="ops-stat" data-stat="pending"><strong id="stat-pending">0</strong><span>Awaiting review</span></button><button class="ops-stat" data-stat="validated"><strong id="stat-validated">0</strong><span>Validated</span></button><button class="ops-stat" data-stat="invalidated"><strong id="stat-invalidated">0</strong><span>Invalidated</span></button><button class="ops-stat" data-stat="issues"><strong id="stat-issues">0</strong><span>Link issues</span></button></div>
      <nav class="ops-nav" role="tablist" aria-label="Operations"><button role="tab" id="tab-discover" aria-controls="panel-discover" aria-selected="true" data-mode="discover">01 Discover</button><button role="tab" id="tab-review" aria-controls="panel-review" aria-selected="false" data-mode="review">02 Review queue</button><button role="tab" id="tab-catalog" aria-controls="panel-catalog" aria-selected="false" data-mode="catalog">03 Catalog</button><button role="tab" id="tab-history" aria-controls="panel-history" aria-selected="false" data-mode="history">Search history</button></nav>
      <p id="ops-message" class="ops-message" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
      <p id="ops-progress" class="ops-progress" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
      <section id="panel-discover" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-discover">
        <div class="ops-section-intro"><div><h2>Search beyond the atlas.</h2><p>Explore a source, then retrieve promising results into the review queue. Search results stay unpublished until you validate them.</p></div><span class="ops-cost" id="ops-budget"></span></div>
        <div class="ops-sources" id="ops-sources" aria-label="Discovery source"></div>
        <form id="ops-discover-form" class="ops-discover-search" role="search"><label class="visually-hidden" for="ops-discover-q">Discover new tools and resources</label><input id="ops-discover-q" type="search" placeholder="What are you researching? e.g. continuous product discovery" minlength="2" maxlength="250" required/><button class="btn primary" type="submit" id="ops-discover-submit">Search the web ↗</button></form>
        <p class="ops-source-help" id="ops-source-help"></p>
        <details class="ops-setup" id="ops-setup" hidden><summary>Connect web, YouTube and X searches</summary><p>Set <code>TREG_TOKEN</code> and, for personal tokens, <code>TREG_ORG</code> in the API server environment. A connected local Treg CLI can be enabled with <code>TREG_CLI=/absolute/path/to/treg</code>. No separate YouTube or X key is required through Treg. Every paid search is capped at $0.02 and the daily budget defaults to $1.</p></details>
        <details class="ops-manual"><summary>Already have a URL? Retrieve it directly.</summary><form id="ops-manual-form"><label>Source URL<input type="url" name="url" required placeholder="https://…" maxlength="2000"/></label><label>Save as<select name="kind"><option value="resource">Learning resource</option><option value="tool">Tool</option></select></label><button class="btn" type="submit">Retrieve URL ↓</button></form></details>
        <div class="ops-toolbar" id="ops-discovery-toolbar" hidden><label><input type="checkbox" id="ops-select-discovery"/>Select all</label><span id="ops-discovery-count"></span><span class="spacer"></span><label>Retrieve as<select id="ops-retrieve-kind"><option value="auto">Suggested kind</option><option value="tool">Tools</option><option value="resource">Resources</option></select></label><button class="btn small" id="ops-retrieve-selected" disabled>Retrieve selected ↓</button></div>
        <ul class="ops-list" id="ops-discovery-results"></ul><div class="ops-empty" id="ops-discovery-empty">Start with a topic. Search articles, videos, threads, repositories or product launches.</div>
      </section>
      <section id="panel-review" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-review" hidden><div id="ops-review-slot"></div></section>
      <section id="panel-catalog" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-catalog" hidden><div id="ops-catalog-slot"></div></section>
      <section id="panel-history" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-history" hidden><div class="ops-section-intro"><div><h2>Your discovery trail.</h2><p>Searches are saved with their source, time and actual provider cost. Repeat a query within 15 minutes to reuse its results.</p></div></div><div id="ops-history"></div></section>
      <div id="ops-entries-workspace" hidden>
        <div class="ops-section-intro"><div><h2 id="ops-entries-title">Review the evidence.</h2><p id="ops-entries-help">Retrieve a source, edit its description and atlas links, then validate or invalidate it. A successful HTTP check alone does not approve an entry.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><button type="button" class="btn small" id="ops-refresh">Refresh</button><button type="button" class="btn small" id="ops-export">Export JSON ↓</button></div></div>
        <form class="ops-filters" id="ops-entry-filters"><input name="q" type="search" aria-label="Search review entries" placeholder="Search title, description, author, domain…"/><select name="status" aria-label="Review status"><option value="">Any status</option><option value="pending">Pending</option><option value="validated">Validated</option><option value="invalidated">Invalidated</option></select><select name="kind" aria-label="Entry kind"><option value="">Tools & resources</option><option value="tool">Tools</option><option value="resource">Resources</option></select><select name="territory" id="ops-filter-territory" aria-label="Territory"><option value="">All territories</option></select><select name="health" aria-label="Link health"><option value="">Any link health</option><option value="issues">Link issues</option><option value="unchecked">Never retrieved</option><option value="due">Review due (90 days)</option></select></form>
        <div class="ops-toolbar"><label><input type="checkbox" id="ops-select-entries"/>Select page</label><span id="ops-entry-count"></span><span class="spacer"></span><button class="btn small" id="ops-check-selected" disabled>Check selected links</button></div>
        <ul class="ops-list" id="ops-entries"></ul><div class="ops-empty" id="ops-entries-empty" hidden>No entries match these filters.</div><nav class="catalog-pagination" id="ops-entry-pagination" aria-label="Review pages"></nav>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <dialog id="ops-detail" class="ops-dialog" aria-labelledby="ops-detail-title"><div class="ops-dialog-head"><h2 id="ops-detail-title">Review entry</h2><span class="ops-status" id="ops-detail-status"></span><button class="btn small" id="ops-detail-close" aria-label="Close entry">×</button></div><div class="ops-dialog-body"><a class="ops-dialog-url" id="ops-detail-url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"></a><p class="ops-message" id="ops-detail-health"></p><p class="ops-message" id="ops-detail-message" role="status" hidden></p>
    <form class="ops-form" id="ops-detail-form"><label>Title<input name="title" required maxlength="500"/></label><label>Why is it useful?<textarea name="description" required maxlength="4000" rows="4"></textarea></label><label>Author / creator<input name="author" maxlength="300"/></label><div class="ops-form-pair"><label>Kind<select name="kind"><option value="tool">Tool</option><option value="resource">Learning resource</option></select></label><label>Format<select name="type"><option value="tool">Tool</option>{['article','video','course','book','docs','talk','podcast','tool-guide','post'].map(t => <option value={t}>{t}</option>)}</select></label></div><div class="ops-form-pair"><label>Pricing<select name="pricing"><option value="unknown">Not assessed</option><option value="free">Free</option><option value="open-source">Open source</option><option value="freemium">Freemium</option><option value="paid">Paid</option></select></label><label>Learning depth<select name="level"><option value="">Not set</option><option value="intro">Start here</option><option value="deep">Go deeper</option></select></label></div>
      <fieldset><legend>Atlas territories · choose at least one</legend><div class="ops-territories" id="ops-detail-territories"></div></fieldset>
      <details><summary>Link related atlas skills and capabilities</summary><label class="visually-hidden" for="ops-skill-search">Find skills</label><input id="ops-skill-search" type="search" placeholder="Filter skills by name…"/><label class="visually-hidden" for="ops-detail-skills">Related skills</label><select id="ops-detail-skills" name="skills" multiple size="7"></select><p>Use Ctrl / Command to select multiple. Selected skills stay visible when filtering.</p></details>
      <label>Review note / invalidation reason<textarea name="note" maxlength="2000" rows="3" placeholder="Quality, relevance, duplicate, broken link, or the evidence behind your decision…"></textarea></label><label class="ops-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="manualVerified"/>I opened the source and verified it manually.</label>
      <details class="ops-evidence"><summary>Retrieved source evidence</summary><p id="ops-detail-evidence"></p><p>Page excerpts are limited to 6,000 characters. Open the original for full context; videos require watching the source.</p></details>
      <div class="ops-dialog-actions"><button class="btn" type="submit">Save changes</button><button class="btn" type="button" id="ops-detail-retrieve">Check source ↻</button><button class="btn primary" type="button" id="ops-detail-validate">Validate ✓</button><button class="btn danger" type="button" id="ops-detail-invalidate">Invalidate ×</button><button class="btn small" type="button" id="ops-detail-pending">Return to pending</button></div>
    </form><section class="ops-audit"><h3>Review history</h3><ul id="ops-detail-history"></ul></section>
  </div></dialog>
</Base>
<script>import '../../catalog/operations.ts';</script>
